; name: Barley twist
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Two spiral grooves round a Ø50 × 400 mm round blank on the rotary axis (along Y, Z0 on the axis), cut with a Ø12 ball nose: one line drawn on the unrolled surface, wrapped round the blank (three turns over its length), cut once per start by a rotary repeat. Change the turns, starts and depth with the variables.
; 
